;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
;通常ルート「第1章　はじめまして」			イベントNo.0
;条件
;　　早苗さんと普通に出会う
;分岐先
;　　Aルート	守矢さんちの現人神			イベントNo.10
;　　Bルート	信者獲得大作戦				イベントNo.20
;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
@M_KOJO_EVENT_K102_シナリオ_0(第m選択肢)
#DIM 第m選択肢

SELECTCASE 第m選択肢
;----------------------------------------------------------------------------
;通常ルート「第1章　はじめまして」			イベントID:0
;第1章第1選択肢(初対面時イベント)
;			A選択肢	粗茶ですが				イベントID:1
;			B選択肢	初接触					イベントID:2
;----------------------------------------------------------------------------
CASE 1
	FONTSTYLE 1
	PRINTFORMW -Chapter 1「%K102_ChapterNames(0)%」-
	PRINTL 
	FONTREGULAR
	PRINTFORMDL You see a tall %PRINT_MALE("boy",102)% with long white hair with an equally as long red dress.
	PRINTFORMDL There's a little piece of hair sticking out at the top, connected with a red hair bobble
	PRINTFORMDL %HIS_HER(102,1)% hair sways with %HIS_HER(102)% movements, unsettling for a %PRINT_MALE("boy",102)% like %HIM_HER(102)%.
	PRINTFORMDW %HIS_HER(102,1)% back gradually moves back towards you, showing %HIS_HER(102)% blue eyes, the glare filling your heart with dread.
	PRINTL
	IF FLAG:周回数 && GETBIT(CFLAG:引き継ぎ, 1)
		PRINTFORMW 「Wait... hold on. Yea, I know you. %NAME:MASTER%.」
		PRINTFORMW 「You were from a different timeline, yes?」
		PRINTFORMDW Uh, huh. Despite reverting time, %CALLNAME:102% still knows you like it was yesterday.
		PRINTFORMW 「I can travel between realms, realities, universes, whatever the Meta World calls it.」
		PRINTL
		PRINTFORML 「Well, no need for introductions then. You know what to do.」
		PRINTFORML 「If you want to test some new stuff, I'll be over at Makai.」
	ELSE
		PRINTFORML 「Hello dear, I'm %NAME:102%.」
		PRINTFORML 「Creator of Makai, the demon world where a bunch of my folk live.」
		PRINTFORML 「I also the founder of Gensou-chan, creating several items which help people in Makai, Gensokyo, and in the Outside World.」
		PRINTFORML 「Sorry for uh, intimidating you. My look kinda causes that, wings and all.」
		PRINTFORMDW Despise %HIS_HER(102)% unsettling appearance, %HE_SHE(102)% seems to be quite a caring %PRINT_MALE("boy",102)%.
		PRINTL
		PRINTFORMDW You introduce yourself as %CALLNAME:MASTER%.
		IF TALENT:MASTER:190 == 6
			PRINTFORML 「%CALLNAME:MASTER%... You're the outsider that managed to get into Gensokyo.」
			PRINTFORML 「Pleased to meet you. I'm looking for some outsiders to test my stuff.」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「%CALLNAME:MASTER%... You're not like the other Youkai in Gensokyo.」
			CALL PRINT_GPC("W", @"「You got a sense of freedom that I haven't seen. Independence, sentience.」", 102)
			CALL PRINT_GP("W", @"What is %CALLNAME:102% talking about? Freedom? Independence? Sentience?")
			PRINTFORML 「Pleased to meet you. I'm looking for someone like you to test my stuff.」
		ENDIF
		PRINTFORML 「If you want to do that, I'll be over at Makai.」
		PRINTFORMDW You tell %HIM_HER(102)% that you don't know where Makai is, even.
		PRINTL
		PRINTFORML 「If you want to get to Makai, just get to know me a bit and I'll point to where the portal is.」
		PRINTFORML 「I'm usually at the Forest of Magic, hanging around with my daughter %NAME:17%.」
		PRINTFORMW 「The other Makais also know where the portal is, get to know them for the same info if you want someone else.」
		PRINTFORML 「Alternatively, take %NAME:55%'s ship from the Temple and ask to go to Makai.」
		PRINTFORMW 「It's not cheap, around \\5000 per trip, but it's only way into there if you don't know where the portal is.」
	ENDIF
	PRINTL
	PRINTFORML 「And take this care package that I specially prepared for you.」
	PRINTFORML 「Contains the bare essentials: A gun, some clothes, and a bottle to keep you hydrated.」
	PRINTFORMW 「You'll probably need them as you probably don't really have a lot to your name.」
	RESETCOLOR
	CALL K102_CarePackages(0)
	CFLAG:102:3100 += 1
	RETURN
;-----------------------------------------------------------------------
;通常ルート「第1章　はじめまして」			イベントNo.0
;第2選択肢(好感度100以上で会話)
;			A選択肢	守矢の風祝				イベントNo.3
;			B選択肢	信じても鰯は鰯			イベントNo.4
;-----------------------------------------------------------------------
CASE 2
	PRINTFORMDL [0]-考えておくよ
	PRINTFORMDL [1]-今度機会があったら
	INPUT
	;どっちにせよ後悔するんかーーい
	IF !RESULT
		;1章第2選択肢Bルート選択[イベントNo.4](信じても鰯は鰯)
		CFLAG:102:3100 += 20
	ELSE
		;1章第2選択肢Aルート選択[イベントNo.3](守矢の風祝)
		CFLAG:102:3100 += 10
	ENDIF
	RETURN
;-----------------------------------------------------------------------
;通常ルート「第1章　はじめまして」			イベントNo.0
;第3選択肢(仕事中で会話、あなたがデート中でない)
;			A選択肢	信者ではないけれど		イベントNo.5
;			B選択肢	やっぱり鰯				イベントNo.6
;-----------------------------------------------------------------------
CASE 3
	PRINTFORMDL [0]-彼女を手伝う
	PRINTFORMDL [1]-いやどす
	INPUT
	;まあ、大半の人はこっちを選ぶんでしょうねー
	IF !RESULT
		CFLAG:102:3100 += 100
	;いやどす(迫真)
	;こっちだと早苗さんの会話がねぇじゃねーかっ！作者のTUGUNAI案件ですなぁ！これはぁ！
	ELSE
		CFLAG:102:3100 += 200
	ENDIF
	RETURN
;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
;通常ルート「第1章　はじめまして」				イベントNo.0
;第4選択肢(好感度500信頼度50を満たす+会話)
;			Aルート	守矢さんちの現人神			イベントNo.10
;			Bルート	信者獲得大作戦				イベントNo.20
;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
CASE 4
	;勧誘手伝いまでの流れを文章で補完
	CALL COLORMESSAGE("-東風谷早苗との関係が『知人』になりました-",C_YELLOW,2,1)
	;2章解放　おめでとう！
	A = CFLAG:102:3100 % 10
	B = (CFLAG:102:3100 / 10) % 10
	C = (CFLAG:102:3100 / 100) % 10
	;通常第2章Aルート分岐「守矢さんちの現人神」No.10
	IF A+B+C < 5
		CFLAG:102:3102 = 10
		PRINTL 
		PRINTFORMDW -第2章「守矢さんちの現人神」-
	;通常第2章Bルート分岐「信者獲得大作戦」No.20
	ELSE
		CFLAG:102:3102 = 20
		PRINTL 
		PRINTFORMDW -第2章「信者獲得大作戦」-
	ENDIF
	FONTREGULAR
CASEELSE
	PRINTL エラー(@M_KOJO_EVENT_K102_シナリオ_0)
ENDSELECT